Description:It is your first main phase. You control Hall of the Bandit Lord ({T}, pay 3 life: add {C}; if that mana is spent on a creature spell, it gains haste) and three untapped Mountains, and have Hill Giant in hand. The opponent is at 3 life and controls no creatures. Reduce the opponent to 0 life this turn.
Rule:authored-mana-rider-haste | Mana can carry an effect that applies to the spell it pays for (CR 106.6): Hill Giant needs all four lands, so the Hall's mana gives it haste and it attacks for 3
